      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "נקרבה הלם אל האלהים",
      "rationale": "Pris i tok 'yumi go klostu hia long Elohim' — i min olsem 'askim Elohim' (olsem BSB), o 'kam klostu long ples bilong ofa'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Na Sha'ul i tok: Yumi go daun bihain long ol Filisti long nait, na yumi baratim ol inap lait bilong moning i kamap, na yumi no ken lusim wanpela man long ol. Na ol i tok: Olgeta samting i gutpela long ai bilong yu, yu wokim. Na pris i tok: Yumi go klostu hia long Elohim.",
